  m_Name: help_saving
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Antarium.Content::Antarium.Content.HelpTopicDef
  id: help_saving
  displayName: Saving and time away
  order: 190
  category: Basics
  icon: memory
  body: 'The game saves by itself every few minutes (Settings > Gameplay), when you quit and when you press {Save}. {Load} goes back to the last save. There are three save slots, each with its own bloodline.


    While the game is closed the colony keeps working at half its recent pace, for up to 8 hours (research and traits raise both): what came into the stock, what it ate, eggs hatching. A Welcome back panel tells you what happened. Raids, weather and other dangers wait until you are back.


    Build up steady production (foraging, belts, machines) and the colony earns while you''re away.'
  reveal: 0
  revealBiome: {fileID: 0}
  revealResearch: {fileID: 0}
